    "text": "<p>The reaction that occurs in a breath analyser, a device used to determine the alcohol level in a person&#39;s blood stream is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>If the rate of appearance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>67</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at a particular time, the rate of disappearance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> at the same time is mol <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> (Nearest integer)</p>"
